- Merge claude_hunter.py + artemis_triage.py into bounty_recon.py (--ai-triage/--ai-plan)
- Shared HTTP/2 client + ThreadPoolExecutor + token-bucket rate limit + retry/backoff
- Scan profiles (passive/safe/aggressive) with an explicit --active gate for OOB probes
- New modules: cache-poisoning probe, retire.js-lite outdated-lib, CORS bypass matrix
- FP fixes: entropy-gated secret tiers, honest SSRF severity, dedup, param-list dupes
- Enable nuclei OAST (was disabled); HTML report; env-configurable AI model
- Repo hygiene: requirements.txt, .gitignore, LICENSE, README matched to real tree

